The full agent context for this repository is in AGENTS.md at the repo root.
Read it before making changes.

Invariants that must not be broken:
- Agents never hold payment credentials (backend/credentials.py).
- Agents can only name catalog providers — no URLs, addresses or amounts.
- Fail closed: policy engine errors mean refuse.
- Policy mutation needs an operator credential; agent credentials are rejected.
- Enforcement and risk scoring are deterministic — no LLM in that path.
- Never claim a capability the code does not have.

Tests: cd backend && python -m pytest -q  (67 tests)
